==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|pharmaco-}} + {{term|-logy}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|/ˌfɑrməˈkɒlədʒi/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{medicine}} The [[science]] that studies the [[effect]]s of [[chemical]] [[compound]]s on [[living]] [[animal]]s, especially the science of the [[manufacture]], [[use]] and [[effect]]s of [[medicinal]] [[drug]]s.
# The [[medicinal]] characteristics of a specific drug.

====Derived terms====
* [[pharmacologic]]
* [[pharmacological]]
* [[pharmacologically]]
* [[pharmacologist]]

